# NPS-HS-SPANGLER-HENRY: "Historical Statement, Henry Spangler Farm Buildings", Frederick Tilberg, Gettysburg National Military Park, August 31, 1956 (a photocopied typescript of 10 pages whose text layer is a damaged OCR).
# Every quote below is typed as the PAGE IMAGE reads (pages 2, 4, 5, 6 and 8 were looked at on 2026-11-16, digits read from the image; the figure 4,800 of page 2 was enlarged to be sure) and aligned by scripts/ocrq.py with the OCR text (scripts/ocr.py) into {{saved|fixed}} pairs; the compiled file is extracts/src/d0-henry-spangler.xdef.
# This is the HENRY Spangler farm on the Emmitsburg Road west of the Emmitsburg Road ridge, NOT the George Spangler farm on Hospital Road (the XI Corps hospital; repository id bld-spangler-farm, hospital H-06): no extract here carries those two ids.
